constraints:
1<=N<=10^{5}
1<=a[i]<=10^{5}
1 <= k <= n*(n-1)/2

expected time complexity: O( N. (Log(N))^{2} )
expected auxiliary space: O(Log(N))

standard_solution_code:
def kthDiff(a, n, k):
	li = []
	for i in range(0, n - 1):
		for j in range(i + 1, n):
			li.append(abs(a[i] - a[j]))
	li.sort()
	return li[k - 1]
